              "text": "11.4 Termination for Convenience. Corio may terminate this Agreement, in whole or in part, for convenience upon thirty (30) days' prior written notice to Commerce One, without penalty, early termination fee or other charge, in which case Commerce One shall refund to Corio any prepaid fees covering the period after the effective date of such termination. Commerce One shall have no right to terminate this Agreement for convenience during the initial five (5) year term or any renewal term."
